<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine March inflation 4.8 pct vs Feb 4.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine March inflation 4.8 pct vs Feb 4.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine year-on-year inflation was at 4.8 percent in March compared with 4.4 percent in February and 11.8 percent in March last year, the National Statistics Office said on Friday.  </p>
<p>   CONSUMER PRICES		Mar 97 Feb 97  Mar 96</p>
<p>   Month-on-month change	+0.8   +0.4    +0.4</p>
<p>   Year-on-year change	  +4.8   +4.4    +11.8</p>
<p>   Index (base 100=1988)	235.8  234.0   224.9</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418937 Fax 8176267</p>
